id: GUIDE12-3
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: lo_self_reliant
target: crates/core/src/lo_self_reliant.rs
find:             SelfRelianceOutcome::CorrectAfterWrong => &mut t.correct_after_wrong,
replace:             SelfRelianceOutcome::CorrectAfterWrong => &mut t.self_reliant_reselected,
expect-fail: no_reselection_wrong_then_correct_is_not_self_reliant
expect-fail: lo4_bundle_counts_only_all_first_correct_participants
note: 集計で誤答の後の正答を自力の側に入れる
